@bookingBaseUrl = http://localhost:5081
@adminAccessToken = {{adminAccessToken}}
@bookingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Preview bookings that have passed the two-year retention period
GET {{bookingBaseUrl}}/privacy/bookings/retention-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Export booking-linked personal data after verifying the requester's identity
GET {{bookingBaseUrl}}/privacy/bookings/{{bookingId}}/export
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Missing bookings return 404
GET {{bookingBaseUrl}}/privacy/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/export
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Pseudonymize direct identifiers after an approved erasure request
DELETE {{bookingBaseUrl}}/privacy/bookings/{{bookingId}}/personal-data
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Missing bookings return 404
DELETE {{bookingBaseUrl}}/privacy/bookings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099/personal-data
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
